# rd_Class (item 12): made from Class/LCDM_v at run time, compiled once into Class/.cache
Class/rd_Class/

# ACT DR6 + Planck PR4 lensing data (items 61, 61c): Observations/act_dr6_lenslike/v1.2/ is LAMBDA's
# ACT_dr6_likelihood_v1.2.tgz. Its twelve correction matrices (225 - 384 MB each, 2.8 GB) are above
# GitHub's 100 MB file limit and stay local (see Observations/act_dr6_lenslike/README.md), as does
# the cache of their binned form. Their binned form for actplanck_baseline (2.9 MB) is in git, so a
# clone needs none of the 2.8 GB
Observations/act_dr6_lenslike/v1.2/like_corrs/N1*.txt
Observations/act_dr6_lenslike/v1.2/like_corrs/*.npy
Observations/act_dr6_lenslike/.cache/
!Observations/act_dr6_lenslike/actplanck_baseline_corrections_v1.2.npz
